      "summary": {
        "en": "In 1755, Qing forces advanced into Ili against the Dzungar ruler Dawachi. Ayusi, a Dzungar soldier serving the Qing, led a night attack near Gedeng. Dawachi fled south of the Tian Shan and was later captured by the ruler of Ush. Qianlong celebrated Ayusi’s service in a poem and commissioned Castiglione to paint him with a lance. The portrait preserves the Qing court’s account of victory.",
        "zh": "1755年，清军进入伊犁，进攻准噶尔统治者达瓦齐。投效清廷的准噶尔军人阿玉锡率队在格登附近夜袭。达瓦齐向天山以南逃走，后被乌什城主擒获。乾隆作歌表彰阿玉锡，并命郎世宁绘制其持矛像。这幅画保存了清廷对胜利的叙述。"
